            "text": "Lectotype (Wijnands, Bot. Commelins: 67. 1983): [icon] \" Anemonospermos Afr. fol. plantaginis flore sulph. \" in Commelin, Hort. Med. Amstelaed. Pl. Rar.: 35, t. 35. 1706."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2:p2",
            "text": "\" Habitat ad Cap. b. spei. \" RCN: 6680."
